{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22527","headline":"东都冬日会诸同年宴郑家林亭 · 白居易","name":"东都冬日会诸同年宴郑家林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛时陪上第，暇日会羣贤。\n桂折因同树，莺迁各异年。\n宾阶纷组佩，妓席俨花钿。\n促膝齐荣贱，差肩次後先。\n助歌林下水，销酒雪中天。\n他日升沈者，无忘共此筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}